  "description": "In Quarantine Lockdown Simulator: Zombie Border, you take on the role of a border guard in a world overwhelmed by a zombie outbreak. You must manage the arrival of survivors and prevent the spread of infection beyond the quarantine zone, making quick and responsible decisions.\nEvery person crossing the border can pose a risk, and every choice can change the fate of your area. As the situation grows increasingly tense, you will learn to prioritize and act under constant pressure.\n\nKey Features:\n\t•\tAccess control: Carefully inspect people arriving at the border for signs of infection.\n\t•\tHealth assessment: Analyze suspicious symptoms to protect the safe zone.\n\t•\tCritical decisions: Allow passage, quarantine, or eliminate threats depending on the situation.\n\t•\tQuarantine management: Monitor and cleanse the isolation area when zombies appear.\n\t•\tRapid defense: Use tactical methods to neutralize threats.\n\t•\tResource recovery: Rest between shifts to maintain alertness.\n\nPrepare to be the last line of defense in a world devastated by zombies, where only vigilance and correct decisions can save lives.",
